---

<ProjectLayout title="Spruce - Prospection LinkedIn IA" description="De la recherche du Lead à la signature comme Client. Automatisez votre prospection LinkedIn de A à Z.">
  <Header />

  <main class="project-page">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="project-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <a href={`${base}#projects`} class="back-link">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
          </svg>
          <span>Retour aux projets</span>
        </a>

        <div class="project-hero-content">
          <div class="hero-logo-row">
            <img src={`${base}projects/spruce-icon.png`} alt="Spruce" class="spruce-logo" />
          </div>
          <span class="project-tag font-mono">Prospection IA LinkedIn</span>
          <h1 class="project-title">Spruce</h1>
          <p class="project-subtitle">De la recherche du Lead à la <em>signature comme Client.</em></p>
          <p class="project-tagline">Prospecter en continu, intelligemment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Scroll Section with fixed image -->
    <section class="scroll-section" id="scroll-section">
      <div class="scroll-container">
        <!-- Fixed Image Container -->
        <div class="scroll-image-container">
          <div class="scroll-images">
            <img src={`${base}projects/working-01.webp`} alt="Spruce Import" class="scroll-img active" data-image="import" />
            <img src={`${base}projects/working-02.webp`} alt="Spruce Prospection" class="scroll-img" data-image="prospect" />
            <img src={`${base}projects/screenshot-crm.jpg`} alt="Spruce CRM" class="scroll-img" data-image="crm" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Scrolling Content -->
        <div class="scroll-content">
          <!-- Origin Section -->
          <div class="content-block" data-trigger="import">
            <span class="content-label font-mono">L'origine</span>
            <h2>Comment Spruce est né</h2>
            <p>
              Un jour, un pote me demande : <em>"T'es capable de créer un outil qui prospecte tout seul sur LinkedIn ?"</em>
            </p>
            <p>
              Ma réponse ? <strong>"Laisse-moi essayer."</strong>
            </p>
            <p>
              C'est comme ça que Spruce est né. From scratch. L'application, le pipeline, l'IA — tout construit de zéro avec une obsession : automatiser la prospection LinkedIn sans perdre l'aspect humain.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="content-block" data-trigger="import">
            <span class="content-label font-mono">Le nom</span>
            <h2>Pourquoi Spruce ?</h2>
            <p>
              <strong>Spruce</strong> — comme l'épicéa, toujours vert, toujours présent. Un arbre robuste qui pousse en toutes conditions.
            </p>
            <p>
              Votre prospection, elle aussi, ne s'arrête jamais. Spruce prospecte pendant que vous dormez, relance pendant que vous pitchez, et classe pendant que vous closez.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="content-block" data-trigger="import">
            <span class="content-label font-mono">Le problème</span>
            <h2>La prospection LinkedIn, c'est l'enfer</h2>
            <p>
              Sales Navigator. Excel. Messagerie LinkedIn. Séquences génériques. Relances oubliées. CRM mal adapté. Des outils éparpillés, des heures perdues à copier-coller.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Spruce réunit tout ça en un seul pipeline.</strong>
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Prospect Section -->
          <div class="content-block" data-trigger="prospect">
            <span class="content-label font-mono">La solution</span>
            <h2>8 étapes. Un seul outil.</h2>
            <p>
              Spruce importe vos leads, les trie, les analyse avec l'IA, prospecte automatiquement, gère les réponses, programme les relances et suit le closing.
            </p>
            <p>
              Vous définissez vos personas. L'IA respecte les restrictions LinkedIn. Et vous reprenez la main quand vous voulez.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="content-block features-list" data-trigger="prospect">
            <h3>Le pipeline complet</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Import</strong> — 5 sources : LinkedIn, Sales Navigator, réactions, CSV</li>
              <li><strong>Tri & Qualification</strong> — Filtre sans photo, inactifs, étudiants</li>
              <li><strong>Scan IA</strong> — Analyse profil et assignation persona</li>
              <li><strong>Prospection IA</strong> — Connexions et messages automatiques</li>
              <li><strong>Réponses</strong> — Toutes les conversations centralisées</li>
              <li><strong>Setting</strong> — Relances intelligentes au bon moment</li>
              <li><strong>Closing</strong> — Du premier RDV à la signature</li>
              <li><strong>Stats</strong> — Dashboard ROI en temps réel</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- CRM Section -->
          <div class="content-block" data-trigger="crm">
            <span class="content-label font-mono">Contrôle</span>
            <h2>Vous gardez la main</h2>
            <p>
              Contrairement aux bots LinkedIn génériques, Spruce vous laisse le contrôle total. Reprenez n'importe quelle conversation. Ajustez les personas. Sélectionnez qui relancer.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>L'IA travaille. Vous décidez.</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features -->
    <section class="features-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Fonctionnalités Clés</h2>
        <div class="features-grid">
          {features.map((feature) => (
            <div class="feature-card">
              <span class="feature-icon" set:html={feature.icon}></span>
              <h3>{feature.title}</h3>
              <p>{feature.description}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pipeline -->
    <section class="algorithm-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Pipeline Complet</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">8 étapes séquentielles — aucun lead ne se perd jamais</p>

        <div class="pipeline-grid">
          {pipeline.map((item) => (
            <div class="pipeline-step">
              <span class="step-number">{item.step}</span>
              <div class="step-content">
                <h3>{item.title}</h3>
                <p>{item.description}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Anti-Detection -->
    <section class="antidetection-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Anti-Détection LinkedIn</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Simulation comportement humain avancée</p>

        <div class="antidetection-grid">
          {antiDetection.map((item) => (
            <div class="antidetection-item">
              <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
              <span>{item}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AI Capabilities -->
    <section class="ai-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Intelligence Artificielle</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">GPT-4 pour une prospection naturelle et personnalisée</p>

        <div class="ai-grid">
          {aiCapabilities.map((item) => (
            <div class="ai-item">
              <span class="ai-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"/><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z"/><path d="M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4"/><path d="M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375"/><path d="M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5"/><path d="M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396"/><path d="M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396"/><path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516"/><path d="M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18"/></svg></span>
              <span>{item}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Stack Technique -->
    <section class="tech-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Stack Technique</h2>

        <div class="tech-category">
          <h3>Backend</h3>
          <div class="tech-bubbles">
            {techStackBackend.map((tech, index) => (
              <div class="tech-bubble" style={`--delay: ${index * 0.3}s; --float-duration: ${3 + (index % 3)}s;`}>
                <img src={tech.logo} alt={tech.name} />
                <span>{tech.name}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-category">
          <h3>Frontend</h3>
          <div class="tech-bubbles">
            {techStackFrontend.map((tech, index) => (
              <div class="tech-bubble" style={`--delay: ${index * 0.3}s; --float-duration: ${3 + (index % 3)}s;`}>
                <img src={tech.logo} alt={tech.name} />
                <span>{tech.name}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-category">
          <h3>Infrastructure</h3>
          <div class="tech-bubbles">
            {techStackInfra.map((tech, index) => (
              <div class="tech-bubble" style={`--delay: ${index * 0.3}s; --float-duration: ${3 + (index % 3)}s;`}>
                <img src={tech.logo} alt={tech.name} />
                <span>{tech.name}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Architecture -->
    <section class="architecture-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Architecture & Sécurité</h2>

        <div class="architecture-grid">
          <div class="architecture-card">
            <div class="arch-header">
              <span class="arch-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="6" y2="6"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="10" y2="10"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="14" y2="14"/><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="18" y2="18"/></svg></span>
              <h3>Architecture</h3>
            </div>
            <ul>
              <li>API RESTful MVC</li>
              <li>Async/await pour toutes les opérations I/O</li>
              <li>Middleware Express (auth, validation, logging)</li>
              <li>Schema validation Mongoose</li>
              <li>WebSocket temps réel (Socket.IO)</li>
              <li>Event delegation pattern</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="architecture-card">
            <div class="arch-header">
              <span class="arch-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></span>
              <h3>Sécurité</h3>
            </div>
            <ul>
              {securityFeatures.map((item) => (
                <li>{item}</li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="architecture-card">
            <div class="arch-header">
              <span class="arch-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg></span>
              <h3>Performance</h3>
            </div>
            <ul>
              <li>Debouncing recherches (300ms)</li>
              <li>Lazy loading données</li>
              <li>Pagination prospects</li>
              <li>Caching résultats API</li>
              <li>Indexes MongoDB optimisés</li>
              <li>Connection pooling</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Points Différenciants -->
    <section class="differentiators-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Points Différenciants</h2>

        <div class="differentiators-list">
          {differentiators.map((item, index) => (
            <div class="differentiator">
              <span class="diff-number">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
              <p>{item}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="project-cta">
      <div class="container">
        <a href="https://getspruce.io" class="cta-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span>Visiter getspruce.io</span>
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H7M17 7V17"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</ProjectLayout>

<script>
  import { gsap } from 'gsap';
  import { ScrollTrigger } from 'gsap/ScrollTrigger';

  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const contentBlocks = document.querySelectorAll('.content-block');
    let currentImage = 'import';

    function switchImage(newImage: string) {
      if (newImage === currentImage) return;

      const currentImg = document.querySelector(`.scroll-img[data-image="${currentImage}"]`);
      const newImg = document.querySelector(`.scroll-img[data-image="${newImage}"]`);

      if (currentImg && newImg) {
        gsap.to(currentImg, {
          opacity: 0,
          duration: 0.4,
          ease: 'power2.inOut',
          onComplete: () => {
            currentImg.classList.remove('active');
          }
        });

        newImg.classList.add('active');
        gsap.fromTo(newImg,
          { opacity: 0 },
          { opacity: 1, duration: 0.4, ease: 'power2.inOut' }
        );

        currentImage = newImage;
      }
    }

    contentBlocks.forEach((block) => {
      const trigger = block.getAttribute('data-trigger');

      ScrollTrigger.create({
        trigger: block,
        start: 'top center',
        end: 'bottom center',
        onEnter: () => {
          if (trigger) switchImage(trigger);
        },
        onEnterBack: () => {
          if (trigger) switchImage(trigger);
        },
      });
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .project-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding-top: 120px;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  /* Section Title */
  .section-title {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 48px;
  }

  /* Back link */
  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* Hero */
  .project-hero {
    padding-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .project-hero-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .hero-logo-row {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .spruce-logo {
    height: 36px;
    width: 36px;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .project-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #57ff96;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(87, 255, 150, 0.3);
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: rgba(87, 255, 150, 0.05);
  }

  .project-title {
    font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 80px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .project-subtitle {
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .project-subtitle em {
    color: #57ff96;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .project-tagline {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* Scroll Sections */
  .scroll-section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .scroll-container {
    max-width: 1600px;
